# 构建产物与本地缓存
/Target/
**/target/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/.kotlin/
**/local.properties
Platforms/Android/.idea/
Platforms/Android/*.iml
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 签名密钥（出包脚本在本机自签测试密钥，位置可用 LINKX_TEST_KEYSTORE 指定）
*.keystore
*.jks
*.pem
/.local-keys/

# 本地产物与临时物
/Temp/
Release/Debug/
/Release/Windows/*
/Release/Android/*
/Release/Docs/*.tar.gz
/Release/Docs/*.zip
/Release/Docs/*.sha256
/Release/*.zip


